OL,3,GNEWSAHolidaymakers driven 86 miles due
OL,4,Ato strike action
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisgruntled holidaymakers are having to
OL,7,Fbe driven 86 miles (138km) to another
OL,8,Fairport, due to strike action.
OL,10,FFlight cancellations mean passengers
OL,11,Fhave had to be taken by coach to London
OL,12,FStansted Airport in Essex.
OL,14,FAir traffic control staff at Norwich
OL,15,FAirport who are members of the Prospect
OL,16,Funion, voted in favour of industrial
OL,17,Faction in relation to pay and
OL,18,Fconditions.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
