OL,3,GNEWSAHolidaymakers driven 86 miles due
OL,4,Ato strike action
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Pace, managing director of
OL,7,FNorwich Airport, said: "We've
OL,8,Fapproached this whole process in good
OL,9,Ffaith, we have negotiated in good
OL,10,Ffaith, we have put a fair and
OL,11,Freasonable offer to Prospect and we are
OL,12,Fvery disappointed."
